# Generated handoff/controller run directories are data-derived local evidence
# packages. Keep them out of normal commits. When GPT needs repository-visible
# context, publish only the smallest reviewed decision packet; do not unignore
# whole result trees.
results/20??????_*/

# Milestone result packets are part of the handoff protocol: the next
# independent reviewer must see the executor's exact top-level outputs. Track
# only first-level text/table artifacts and keep nested runtime outputs ignored.
!results/20??????_*_m[0-9]_*/
results/20??????_*_m[0-9]_*/*
